{
  "info": {
    "name": "routeid",
    "description": "Router OSM Indonesia. URL absolut http://127.0.0.1:8080, tanpa variabel. Jalankan: bin/rid-server -graph data/java.graph -addr :8080. Contoh rute: Warung Sembako Arum -> KiriminAja HQ (Yogyakarta).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. healthz",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/healthz",
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. route points (aman, tanpa decode)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/route?from=-7.8435723,110.392939&to=-7.7393368,110.3760593",
        "description": "Array [lat,lng]. Paling aman untuk dilihat manusia."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. route geojson (tempel ke geojson.io)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/route?from=-7.8435723,110.392939&to=-7.7393368,110.3760593&format=geojson",
        "description": "Field geojson berisi FeatureCollection. Copy isi field itu ke geojson.io. Nol backslash."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. route polyline",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/route?from=-7.8435723,110.392939&to=-7.7393368,110.3760593&format=polyline",
        "description": "Format Google (kompatibel semua decoder). Respons juga memuat polyline_b64 = base64 dari string yang sama; pakai yang b64 kalau mau copy-paste, karena charset polyline memuat '\\' yang tampil dobel di JSON."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. route polyline base64 (aman copy)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/route?from=-7.8435723,110.392939&to=-7.7393368,110.3760593&format=polyline&polyline_enc=b64",
        "description": "polyline_b64 = base64 dari string polyline. Tanpa backslash, jadi tidak bisa rusak saat copy-paste."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. route POST objek",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/route",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"from\": { \"lat\": -7.8435723, \"lng\": 110.392939 },\n  \"to\": { \"lat\": -7.7393368, \"lng\": 110.3760593 },\n  \"format\": \"geojson\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
